\begin_inset Formula 
\[
0<\frac{1-\frac{x}{y^{n}}}{n}
\]

\end_inset

יהי 
\begin_inset Formula $0<\varepsilon'\in\MKreal$
\end_inset

 כך שמתקיים:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\varepsilon'<1,\ \varepsilon'<\frac{1-\frac{x}{y^{n}}}{n}
\]

\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
 & \Rightarrow n\varepsilon<1-\frac{x}{y^{n}}\\
 & \Rightarrow\frac{x}{y^{n}}<1+n\cdot\left(-\varepsilon\right)
\end{align*}

\end_inset

נשים לב לכך ש-
\begin_inset Formula $-1<-\varepsilon'$
\end_inset

 (וגם 
\begin_inset Formula $0<1-\varepsilon'$
\end_inset

